# APP CREATIVE — gates

1. Read only the current APP shard and declared design paths.
2. Write the epic-scoped creative artifact under `memory-bank/app/creative/<epic_id>/`.
3. Close the shard's `needs_creative` marker; do not mark the implementation step complete and do not write production code.
4. Return to APP IMPLEMENT with the same step and contract.
